  'gm.editTitle': 'Change your goals yourself',
  'gm.editHint': 'The evidence-based values are the recommendation. You can change any number: inside its evidence-based range it applies at once; outside it, you will see the warning and its basis, and the change goes through your trainer\u2019s approval or a signed agreement.',
  'gm.founded': 'Evidence-based: {v}',
  'gm.setBtn': 'Apply',
  'gm.warn.kcal': '⚠ Outside the evidence-based range for calories. The evidence-based bands are: maintenance = your estimated expenditure ±5%; gaining = +5% to +15%; losing = the value from the pace decided under the ACSM/NIH educational band (−500…−1000 kcal/day).',
  'gm.warn.prot': '⚠ Outside the evidence-based range for protein. The ISSN position stand (2017) sets 1.4–2.0 g/kg/day for most people who train; in a calorie deficit the evidence-based reference rises (2.2 g/kg here; Helms et al., 2014: 2.3–3.1 g/kg of lean mass) to protect muscle mass.',
  'gm.warn.gras': '⚠ Outside the evidence-based range for fats: 15%–30% of the calorie goal (Helms, Aragon & Fitschen, 2014). Below 15%, the intake of essential fatty acids and fat-soluble vitamins can fall short.',
  'gm.warn.azuc': '⚠ Above the evidence-based sugar value. The World Health Organization (WHO) guideline recommends free sugars below 10% of total energy (strong recommendation) and below 5% for additional benefit (conditional); this app uses the stricter 5% as the evidence-based value. Added sugar is not an essential part of eating.',
  'gm.warn.carb': '⚠ Below the evidence-based reference for carbohydrates: the Institute of Medicine (IOM) sets 130 g/day as the minimum, based on the average amount of glucose the brain uses. Below that reference, the body must produce glucose from other sources.',
  'gm.warn.daytype': '⚠ This day type differs from the one your plan sets for this date (demanding day: carbohydrates +20% paid from fats; rest day: carbohydrates −20% with fats up within their band). Changing it moves this day\u2019s carbohydrates and fats away from the evidence-based values for the date.',
  'gm.appliedDirect': 'Applied. It is inside the evidence-based range.',
  'gm.proposalPending': 'You already have a change waiting for a decision. When it is decided you can send another.',
  'gm.proposalSent': 'Change sent to your trainer. The evidence-based values stay in place until it is decided.',
  'gm.myProposalPending': '⏳ Your change is waiting: {param} → {chosen}. The evidence-based values still apply.',
  'gm.myProposalDecided': 'Your last change ({param} → {chosen}) was decided: {status}.',
  'gm.status.rejected': 'rejected',
  'gm.dayTypeTitle': 'Day type (your call)',
  'gm.dayTypeDetected': 'For {date} your plan sets: {level}. You can set another type.',
  'gm.dayTypeApply': 'Set day type',
  'gm.agreeTitle': 'Agreement for this change',
  'gm.agreementText': 'Version v2-2026-11-03. By accepting, I confirm that: (1) the app showed me the warning and the scientific basis for the evidence-based value of the number I am changing, and the evidence-based value and my chosen value are recorded with this acceptance, with the date; (2) the evidence-based values are an educational reference, not medical advice; (3) I make this change strictly under my own responsibility and I release the platform and my trainer, if I have one, from responsibility for effects on my health that may result from this change; (4) I can return to the evidence-based values at any time from this same screen.',
  'gm.agreementDraftNotice': 'The agreement that would cover this change is still a draft pending approval, so the change cannot be applied yet. The evidence-based values stay in place.',
  'gm.agreeAccept': 'I accept the agreement and apply the change',
